                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58c852ef-8911-3d34-ad2b-cbd7dbe6ff2a",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5a6063-9d68-333b-8236-6bf50c1460dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a body in motion: the tendency of a body to maintain its inertial motion; the product of its mass and velocity, or the vector sum of the products of its masses and velocities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e19e21c-604f-3b59-af6a-ded1f1d33016",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5a6063-9d68-333b-8236-6bf50c1460dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Strength or force gained by motion or movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad1cf7e8-669f-3980-9941-1da9ba2d881b",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5a6063-9d68-333b-8236-6bf50c1460dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The impetus, either of a body in motion, or of an idea or course of events; a moment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6669d698-9cb3-4633-863f-ee12aef02109",
                                                "sense_id": "ad1cf7e8-669f-3980-9941-1da9ba2d881b",
                                                "text": "The travellers swarm forth from the cars. All are full of the momentum which they have caught from their mode of conveyance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fac09c7-c0c8-4111-aeca-861bea013c6a",
                                                "sense_id": "ad1cf7e8-669f-3980-9941-1da9ba2d881b",
                                                "text": "Their intention to become husband and wife, at first halting and timorous, had accumulated momentum with the lapse of hours, till it now bore down every obstacle in its course."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccb8e740-ede9-4e7a-b45c-c08dd94faae7",
                                                "sense_id": "ad1cf7e8-669f-3980-9941-1da9ba2d881b",
                                                "text": "Though his account of written communication over the past 5,000 years necessarily has a powerful forward momentum, his diversions down the fascinating byways of the subject are irresistible ..."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4483a05a-9be9-3df9-b535-28b82df81ee9",
                                        "entry_id": "ad5a6063-9d68-333b-8236-6bf50c1460dd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The surmise of an accelerated price trend in the technical analysis of an asset."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c07df39-56b8-4358-95b5-d07ab5d7d2b4",
                        "source_entry_id": "9afb5893-5b1b-3bca-96a2-e4436b9f7668",
